2026-07-27T07:48:50.1792714Z i /tmp/RtmpRLcF8A/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:48:50.1793294Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:48:50.1793712Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:48:50.1794294Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:48:50.1794859Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:48:50.1795649Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:48:50.1796322Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
